    "Sizing Method: Set (uses Size, ignores input), Add (input size plus Size) or Multiply (input size times Multiply Size)",
    "Size and Multiply Size: values used by the chosen sizing method",
    "Set Type Info: None, Position, Vector, Normal, Color, Quaternion, Transform Matrix or Texture Coordinate"
  ],
